  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EBRD - Ukrnafta Emergency Distributed Generation Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support through EBRD Crisis Response Special Fund (&#x2018;CRSF&#x2019;) sub-account window. The objectives of this funding are to support &#x201C;Ukraine&#x2019;s energy security as well as securing the livelihood of the Ukrainian population&#x201D; (&#x201C;target group&#x201D;), with electricity and heat. With these funds, Ukrnafta plans to install up to 100 MW of smaller, distributed and flexible gas-fired generation assets.</narrative>
  </description>
